and Chalfont St Giles, Bucks, UK","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 2.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 2.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"true","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"LicenseUrl":{"value":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Copyrighted":{"value":"True","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"cc-by-sa-2.0","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}},"mime":"image/jpeg"}]},"165950358":{"pageid":165950358,"ns":6,"title":"File:Minimize Campfire Impacts- Day 6 - The Seven Days of Leave No Trace (11558251555).webm","index":10,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":10866031,"width":1280,"height":720,"duration":75.675,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f0/Minimize_Campfire_Impacts-_Day_6_-_The_Seven_Days_of_Leave_No_Trace_%2811558251555%29.webm/1280px--Minimize_Campfire_Impacts-_Day_6_-_The_Seven_Days_of_Leave_No_Trace_%2811558251555%29.webm.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo","thumbwidth":1280,"thumbheight":720,"thumbattribs":[],"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f0/Minimize_Campfire_Impacts-_Day_6_-_The_Seven_Days_of_Leave_No_Trace_%2811558251555%29.webm?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Minimize_Campfire_Impacts-_Day_6_-_The_Seven_Days_of_Leave_No_Trace_(11558251555).webm","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=165950358","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2025-05-24 23:31:19","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"Minimize Campfire Impacts- Day 6 - The Seven Days of Leave No Trace (11558251555)","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"2013-12-25|PD US NPS|Flickr images missing SDC creator|Uploaded with video2commons|Videos from Grand Canyon National Park|Video display resolution 1280 x 720|Videos of 2013 from the United States|Flickr videos review needed|Files from Grand Canyon NPS Flickr stream|U.S. National Park Service Flickr files uploaded by OptimusPrimeBot|United States National Park Service images (review needed)","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"Image Description: a woman wearing a white and red headband, is using a small propane campstove that is placed on a large slab of rock. In the background, tree branches, and a canyon wall. \n<p>Before hiking in the canyon, all backpackers should be aware\nCampfires are not allowed in the backcountry, no how nowhere\nCampers instead should bring a stove with some fuel\nSelf-contained stoves for cooking is the rule\n</p><p>Make sure your flame never gets out of control\nA wayward spark can turn the canyon to nothing but charcoal\nFire spreads quickly in this desert place\nJeopardizing plants, animals and everything else in this space\nCacti and trees can take decades or more\nTo grow back to their splendor, the condition we adore\nFire scars are ugly, black and full of ashes\nThey spread through campsites and with your gear clashes\nBesides, fires block the magnificent night sky\nThey drown out the stars which otherwise seem close by\n</p><p>So be sure not to light a fire on your backcountry trek\nGrand Canyon thanks you for treating this rule with respect\n</p>\n- Andrea Tavegia, Grand Canyon National Park Backcountry Information Center","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"Taken on\u00a025 December 2013, 19:45:30","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/grand_canyon_nps/11558251555\">Minimize Campfire Impacts: Day 6 - The Seven Days of Leave No Trace</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/people/grand_canyon_nps/\">Grand Canyon NPS</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"false","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Copyrighted":{"value":"False","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"pd","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}},"mime":"video/webm"}]},"93045207":{"pageid":93045207,"ns":6,"title":"File:The Boy scouts book of campfire stories (IA boyscoutsbookofc00math).pdf","index":9,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":154490611,"width":1272,"height":2070,"pagecount":314,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/The_Boy_scouts_book_of_campfire_stories_%28IA_boyscoutsbookofc00math%29.pdf/page1-960px-The_Boy_scouts_book_of_campfire_stories_%28IA_boyscoutsbookofc00math%29.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":2400,"thumbheight":3906,"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/The_Boy_scouts_book_of_campfire_stories_%28IA_boyscoutsbookofc00math%29.pdf/page1-960px-The_Boy_scouts_book_of_campfire_stories_%28IA_boyscoutsbookofc00math%29.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":2400,"height":3906},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cf/The_Boy_scouts_book_of_campfire_stories_%28IA_boyscoutsbookofc00math%29.pdf?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://com